---
layout: layouts/landing.njk
description: "Overseer is an AI computer vision and spatial intelligence platform: real-time detection, tracking, monocular depth, 3D reconstruction, cross-camera re-identification and event analytics, self-hosted and offline-capable."
---
<div class="landing">

  <section class="hero-v">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">AI Computer Vision · Spatial Intelligence</p>
      <h1>Turn any camera into spatial intelligence.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Detection, depth, 3D reconstruction and cross-camera identity. Self-hosted and offline-capable.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ '/docs/quick-start/' | url }}">Get started</a>
        <a class="btn" href="{{ site.repo }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-frame reveal">
      <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="{{ '/assets/img/shots/demo-map-poster.webp' | url }}">
        <source src="{{ '/assets/img/shots/demo-map.mp4' | url }}" type="video/mp4">
      </video>
      <figcaption class="frame-cap">Live command center · cameras, detection and analysis</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <div class="divider reveal"><span>Detection · Depth · 3D · Identity · Analytics</span></div>

  <section class="frow reveal">
    <figure class="shot-frame"><img loading="lazy" src="{{ '/assets/img/shots/detect.webp' | url }}" width="1460" height="900" alt="Live detection overlays with track ids"></figure>
    <div class="frow-copy">
      <p class="section-label">Perception</p>
      <h2>Detection &amp; tracking</h2>
      <p class="muted">People, vehicles, animals and hazards, followed with stable identities through occlusion.</p>
      <div class="chips">{% for t in ["YOLO11","ByteTrack","Class gating"] %}<span class="chip">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="frow reverse reveal">
    <figure class="shot-frame">
      <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="{{ '/assets/img/shots/recon-poster.webp' | url }}">
        <source src="{{ '/assets/img/shots/recon.mp4' | url }}" type="video/mp4">
      </video>
    </figure>
    <div class="frow-copy">
      <p class="section-label">Depth &amp; 3D</p>
      <h2>Lift a frame into 3D</h2>
      <p class="muted">Monocular depth reconstructs a navigable point cloud you can fly through.</p>
      <div class="chips">{% for t in ["Depth Anything V2","Point cloud","Mesh"] %}<span class="chip">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="frow reveal">
    <figure class="shot-frame"><img loading="lazy" src="{{ '/assets/img/shots/profile.webp' | url }}" width="1280" height="800" alt="A subject profile: who, when and where they were seen"></figure>
    <div class="frow-copy">
      <p class="section-label">Identity</p>
      <h2>Know who, when &amp; where</h2>
      <p class="muted">Cross-camera re-identification builds a long-term profile of every subject: sightings, movement and links.</p>
      <div class="chips">{% for t in ["Re-ID + gait","Dossiers","Relationship graph"] %}<span class="chip">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="frow reverse reveal">
    <figure class="shot-frame"><img loading="lazy" src="{{ '/assets/img/shots/map.webp' | url }}" width="1280" height="800" alt="Command-center map with every camera source"></figure>
    <div class="frow-copy">
      <p class="section-label">Multi-camera</p>
      <h2>One command center</h2>
      <p class="muted">Every source on a live map, correlated into one operational picture with zones, rules and alerts.</p>
      <div class="chips">{% for t in ["Live map","Zones","Threat scoring"] %}<span class="chip">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band reveal">
    <div><p class="section-label">Open source</p><h2 style="margin-top:6px">Built in the open, MIT licensed</h2></div>
    <div class="row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ '/docs/' | url }}">Read the docs</a>
      <a class="btn" href="{{ site.repo }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ site.repoShort }} →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
